Module(
  body=[
    Expr(
      value=Constant(value='\nResume Generation Engine v5.46 - CONSOLIDATED QA ENHANCEMENT PATCH\n\nv5.46 CHANGES - COMPREHENSIVE QA TABLE REQUIREMENTS & OUTPUT CONSOLIDATION:\n\nCRITICAL CHANGES FROM CONVERSATION:\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n\n1. OUTPUT CONSOLIDATION\n   ✓ REMOVED: Output 4 (Word Table) - was duplicate of QA Report 1\n   ✓ Output sequence now: 1, 2, 3, [SKIP 4], 5\n   ✓ Total word count moved to final row of QA Table 1\n   ✓ QA Table 2 repurposed for Token Usage tracking\n\n2. QA PROVENANCE TABLE ENHANCEMENT (IBM/UNIFY)\n   ✓ NEW COLUMN: Provenance Category (Verbatim/Synthesized/Transformed)\n   ✓ MANDATORY for every bullet point\n   ✓ Cannot be blank, null, or "Unknown"\n   ⛔ BLOCKING: Output rejected if any bullet lacks category\n\n3. NEW QA TABLE 2: TOKEN USAGE & TEMPERATURE TRACKING\n   ✓ Track tokens per HOP requiring LLM API calls\n   ✓ Temperature setting per resume section\n   ✓ Weighted average temperature calculation\n   ✓ API verification status (Yes/No)\n   ✓ ISO 8601 timestamps\n   ⛔ BLOCKING: If any API call unverified, output blocked\n\n4. QA TABLE 3: SIGNAL COMPLIANCE BY SECTION (ENHANCED)\n   ✓ Expected vs Actual signal tracked PER SECTION\n   ✓ Weighted overall signal calculation\n   ✓ Weighting methodology documented in Notes\n   ⛔ BLOCKING: If section-level detail missing, output blocked\n\n5. GEMINI FORMATTING FIXES\n   ✓ Output 1 bullets: Plain text in separate rows (no markdown bullets)\n   ✓ All outputs: NO code fences (```) anywhere\n   ✓ Tables: Unfenced markdown starting with |\n   ✓ Blank lines between outputs for Word compatibility\n\n6. COMPREHENSIVE BLOCKING VALIDATION\n   ⛔ All QA tables must be complete or output is BLOCKED\n   ⛔ Missing data = output not delivered\n   ⛔ Ensures quality gates are enforced\n\nBUILD: October 19, 2025\nVERSION: 5.46 (Consolidated from conversation)\nREPLACES: v5.45\n\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n')),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='json')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='re')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='hashlib')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='math')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='os')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='time')]),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='requests')]),
    ImportFrom(
      module='typing',
      names=[
        alias(name='Dict'),
        alias(name='List'),
        alias(name='Tuple'),
        alias(name='Optional'),
        alias(name='Any'),
        alias(name='Set')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='enum',
      names=[
        alias(name='Enum')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='datetime',
      names=[
        alias(name='datetime')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='dataclasses',
      names=[
        alias(name='dataclass'),
        alias(name='field'),
        alias(name='asdict')],
      level=0),
    ImportFrom(
      module='pathlib',
      names=[
        alias(name='Path')],
      level=0),
    Import(
      names=[
        alias(name='copy')]),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='__version__', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='5.46')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='OUTPUT_SEQUENCE_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Dict(
        keys=[
          Constant(value=1),
          Constant(value=2),
          Constant(value=3),
          Constant(value=4),
          Constant(value=5)],
        values=[
          Constant(value='Resume text with bullets in separate rows (Word-compatible)'),
          Constant(value='Resume metadata plain text'),
          Constant(value='Cover letter plain text'),
          Constant(value='REMOVED - Was duplicate word count table (now in QA Report 1 final row)'),
          Constant(value='Multiple QA tables (unfenced, separated by blank lines)')])),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='QA_TABLE_1_SCHEMA_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='\nWORD COUNT COMPLIANCE QA TABLE REQUIREMENTS (v5.46):\n\nMANDATORY COLUMN STRUCTURE (7 columns):\n| Section | Expected (words) | Actual (words) | Variance (words) | Variance % | Tolerance | Pass/Fail |\n\nCRITICAL CHANGES:\n- Column "Range" renamed to "Tolerance"  \n- Tolerance format: "+/- X%" (not absolute ranges)\n- Variance (words): Integer with sign (+5, -10, 0)\n- Variance %: Percentage with 1 decimal and sign (+3.5%, -2.0%)\n- MUST include "Total" as FINAL ROW (consolidates old QA Table 2)\n- Total row uses stricter tolerance (+/- 5% typically)\n- Individual sections use +/- 10% tolerance typically\n\nEXAMPLE:\n| Section    | Expected (words) | Actual (words) | Variance (words) | Variance % | Tolerance | Pass/Fail |\n|------------|------------------|----------------|------------------|------------|-----------|-----------|\n| Summary    | 150              | 145            | -5               | -3.3%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      |\n| Experience | 300              | 285            | -15              | -5.0%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      |\n| Education  | 50               | 52             | +2               | +4.0%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      |\n| Skills     | 75               | 90             | +15              | +20.0%     | +/- 10%   | Fail      |\n| Total      | 575              | 572            | -3               | -0.5%      | +/- 5%    | Pass      |\n\nBLOCKING CONDITIONS:\n- Missing Total row → BLOCK\n- Wrong column names → BLOCK\n- Missing sections → BLOCK\n')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='QA_PROVENANCE_SCHEMA_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='\nPROVENANCE TRACKING QA TABLE REQUIREMENTS (v5.46):\n\nMANDATORY COLUMN STRUCTURE (7 columns):\n| Bullet # | Content Summary | Source | Provenance Category | IBM Score | Unify Score | Notes |\n\nNEW COLUMN (v5.46): Provenance Category\n- REQUIRED for every single bullet point\n- Must be one of: "Verbatim", "Synthesized", "Transformed"\n- Cannot be blank, null, "Unknown", "N/A", or "TBD"\n\nPROVENANCE CATEGORY DEFINITIONS:\n- Verbatim: Copied word-for-word from source (>95% match)\n- Synthesized: Combined from multiple sources or human-rewritten\n- Transformed: AI-generated enhancement with >30% structural change\n\nEXAMPLE:\n| Bullet # | Content Summary | Source | Provenance Category | IBM Score | Unify Score | Notes |\n|----------|-----------------|--------|---------------------|-----------|-------------|-------|\n| 1        | Led AI team of 50+ | Resume v2.1 | Verbatim | 98 | 97 | Direct copy |\n| 2        | Increased revenue 40% | LinkedIn + Resume v2.0 | Synthesized | 85 | 88 | Combined sources |\n| 3        | Architected ML platform | Previous + AI enhancement | Transformed | 72 | 75 | LLM enhanced |\n\nBLOCKING CONDITIONS:\n- ANY bullet missing Provenance Category → BLOCK OUTPUT\n- Any category value other than the 3 allowed values → BLOCK\n- Empty/null category → BLOCK\n')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='QA_TABLE_2_TOKEN_USAGE_SCHEMA_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='\nNEW QA TABLE 2: TOKEN USAGE & TEMPERATURE TRACKING (v5.46)\n\nPURPOSE: Verify LLM API calls were made and track resource usage.\nReplaces old QA Table 2 (total word count now in QA Table 1 final row).\n\nMANDATORY COLUMN STRUCTURE (7 columns):\n| Resume Section | HOP ID | LLM Provider | Tokens Used | Temperature | API Call Verified | Timestamp |\n\nCOLUMN DEFINITIONS:\n1. Resume Section: Section name (Summary, Experience, Education, Skills, etc.)\n2. HOP ID: Specific HOP identifier requiring LLM call (e.g., HOP-001, HOP-002)\n3. LLM Provider: "Gemini" or "Claude" (must match actual provider)\n4. Tokens Used: Integer token count consumed (must be > 0)\n5. Temperature: Temperature setting (0.0-1.0, typically 0.2-0.7)\n6. API Call Verified: "Yes" or "No" - confirmation call was made\n7. Timestamp: ISO 8601 format (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ)\n\nMANDATORY TOTAL ROW:\n- Must include TOTAL row as final row\n- Total Tokens Used: Sum of all tokens\n- Weighted Average Temperature: Σ(tokens_i × temp_i) / Σ(tokens_i)\n- API Call Verified: "All Verified" if all rows = Yes\n\nWEIGHTED TEMPERATURE FORMULA:\nweighted_temp = (tokens_section1 × temp_section1 + tokens_section2 × temp_section2 + ...) / total_tokens\n\nEXAMPLE:\n| Resume Section | HOP ID | LLM Provider | Tokens Used | Temperature | API Call Verified | Timestamp |\n|----------------|--------|--------------|-------------|-------------|-------------------|-----------|\n| Summary        | HOP-001| Gemini       | 1,250       | 0.3         | Yes               | 2025-10-19T14:23:15Z |\n| Experience     | HOP-002| Gemini       | 2,800       | 0.4         | Yes               | 2025-10-19T14:24:32Z |\n| Education      | HOP-003| Claude       | 650         | 0.2         | Yes               | 2025-10-19T14:25:01Z |\n| Skills         | HOP-004| Gemini       | 420         | 0.3         | Yes               | 2025-10-19T14:25:18Z |\n| **TOTAL**      | **-**  | **Mixed**    | **5,120**   | **0.35**    | **All Verified**  | **-** |\n\nCALCULATION EXAMPLE:\n(1250×0.3 + 2800×0.4 + 650×0.2 + 420×0.3) / 5120 = 0.348 ≈ 0.35\n\nBLOCKING CONDITIONS:\n⛔ ANY row with "API Call Verified" = "No" → BLOCK OUTPUT\n⛔ Missing TOTAL row → BLOCK\n⛔ Missing weighted temperature → BLOCK\n⛔ Token count = 0 or negative → BLOCK\n⛔ Suspicious token counts (too low/high) → FLAG for review\n')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='QA_TABLE_3_SIGNAL_COMPLIANCE_SCHEMA_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='\nQA TABLE 3: SIGNAL COMPLIANCE BY SECTION (v5.46 ENHANCED)\n\nPURPOSE: Track expected vs actual signal strength BY RESUME SECTION.\nPrevious versions only tracked total - v5.46 requires section-level detail.\n\nMANDATORY COLUMN STRUCTURE (8 columns):\n| Resume Section | Expected Signal | Actual Signal | Variance | Variance % | Tolerance | Pass/Fail | Notes |\n\nCOLUMN DEFINITIONS:\n1. Resume Section: Section name (Summary, Experience, Education, Skills, Total)\n2. Expected Signal: Target signal strength (0-100 scale)\n3. Actual Signal: Measured signal from resume (0-100 scale)\n4. Variance: Difference (Actual - Expected)\n5. Variance %: Percentage difference ((Actual - Expected) / Expected × 100)\n6. Tolerance: Acceptable deviation (e.g., "+/- 10%")\n7. Pass/Fail: "Pass" if within tolerance, "Fail" otherwise\n8. Notes: Context (e.g., "Market feedback prioritized")\n\nSIGNAL SCALE (0-100):\n- 0-30: Low signal (generic, weak content)\n- 31-60: Medium signal (adequate, standard content)\n- 61-80: High signal (strong, specific content)\n- 81-100: Exceptional signal (outstanding, unique content)\n\nMANDATORY TOTAL ROW:\n- Shows WEIGHTED AVERAGE SIGNAL across all sections\n- Must document weighting methodology in Notes\n- Common weighting: Experience (50%), Summary (25%), Skills (15%), Education (10%)\n- Formula: weighted_signal = Σ(signal_i × weight_i) / Σ(weight_i)\n\nEXAMPLE:\n| Resume Section | Expected Signal | Actual Signal | Variance | Variance % | Tolerance | Pass/Fail | Notes |\n|----------------|-----------------|---------------|----------|------------|-----------|-----------|-------|\n| Summary        | 75              | 78            | +3       | +4.0%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      | Strong opening |\n| Experience     | 80              | 82            | +2       | +2.5%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      | Quantified results |\n| Education      | 60              | 58            | -2       | -3.3%      | +/- 15%   | Pass      | Standard format |\n| Skills         | 70              | 65            | -5       | -7.1%      | +/- 10%   | Pass      | Needs tech refresh |\n| **Total (Weighted)** | **76**    | **77**        | **+1**   | **+1.3%**  | **+/- 5%**| **Pass**  | **Weight: Exp 50%, Sum 25%, Skill 15%, Edu 10%** |\n\nWEIGHTED SIGNAL CALCULATION:\n(78×0.25 + 82×0.50 + 58×0.10 + 65×0.15) = 77.05 ≈ 77\n\nBLOCKING CONDITIONS:\n⛔ Missing individual section signals (only showing Total) → BLOCK\n⛔ Missing Total weighted signal → BLOCK\n⛔ Weighting methodology not documented → BLOCK\n⛔ Signal values outside 0-100 range → BLOCK\n')),
    Assign(
      targets=[
        Name(id='GEMINI_FORMATTING_PATCH_V546', ctx=Store())],
      value=Constant(value='\nGEMINI OUTPUT FORMATTING REQUIREMENTS (v5.46):\n\nCRITICAL: Gemini tends to wrap outputs in code fences. This breaks Word paste compatibility.\n\nOUTPUT 1: PLAIN UNFENCED TEXT WITH BULLETS IN SEPARATE ROWS\n- Write text directly without markdown code fences\n- NO backticks, NO wrappers, NO formatting blocks\n- Each bullet point MUST be on its own separate row/line\n- Add blank line between each bullet for Word compatibility\n- Do NOT use markdown bullet format (- or *)\n- Use simple line breaks between items\n\nCORRECT OUTPUT 1:\nFirst bullet point item\n\nSecond bullet point item\n\nThird bullet point item\n\nOUTPUTS 2-3: PLAIN UNFENCED TEXT\n- Write text directly without code fences\n- No backticks, no wrappers\n\nOUTPUT 4: REMOVED\n- Do NOT generate Output 4\n- Was duplicate of QA Report 1\n\nOUTPUT 5: SEPARATE UNFENCED QA TABLES\n- Create MULTIPLE distinct markdown tables\n- NO code fences around any table\n- Separate each table with 2 blank lines\n- Tables start with | character directly\n\nFORBIDDEN PATTERNS:\n❌ ```markdown\n❌ ```text\n❌ ```\n❌ Any backtick wrapper\n❌ Markdown bullets (- or *) in Output 1\n❌ Generating Output 4\n\nVALIDATION CHECKLIST:\n□ No ``` anywhere in output\n□ No backticks used\n□ Output 1 bullets in separate rows with blank lines\n□ No markdown bullet symbols (- or *) in Output 1\n□ Outputs 2-3 are plain text\n□ Output 4 does NOT exist\n□ Output 5 QA tables are separate with blank lines\n□ Tables start with |\n')),
    ClassDef(
      name='ValidationSeverity',
      bases=[
        Name(id='Enum', ctx=Load())],
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='Validation severity levels for v5.46.')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='INFO', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='INFO')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='WARNING', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='WARNING')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='ERROR', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='ERROR')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='CRITICAL', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='CRITICAL')),
        Assign(
          targets=[
            Name(id='BLOCKING', ctx=Store())],
          value=Constant(value='BLOCKING'))]),
    ClassDef(
      name='QAValidationResult',
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='Result of QA table validation (v5.46).')),
        AnnAssign(
          target=Name(id='table_name', ctx=Store()),
          annotation=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()),
          simple=1),
        AnnAssign(
          target=Name(id='is_valid', ctx=Store()),
          annotation=Name(id='bool', ctx=Load()),
          simple=1),
        AnnAssign(
          target=Name(id='blocking_issues', ctx=Store()),
          annotation=Subscript(
            value=Name(id='List', ctx=Load()),
            slice=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()),
            ctx=Load()),
          value=Call(
            func=Name(id='field', ctx=Load()),
            keywords=[
              keyword(
                arg='default_factory',
                value=Name(id='list', ctx=Load()))]),
          simple=1),
        AnnAssign(
          target=Name(id='warning_issues', ctx=Store()),
          annotation=Subscript(
            value=Name(id='List', ctx=Load()),
            slice=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()),
            ctx=Load()),
          value=Call(
            func=Name(id='field', ctx=Load()),
            keywords=[
              keyword(
                arg='default_factory',
                value=Name(id='list', ctx=Load()))]),
          simple=1),
        AnnAssign(
          target=Name(id='severity', ctx=Store()),
          annotation=Name(id='ValidationSeverity', ctx=Load()),
          value=Attribute(
            value=Name(id='ValidationSeverity', ctx=Load()),
            attr='INFO',
            ctx=Load()),
          simple=1)],
      decorator_list=[
        Name(id='dataclass', ctx=Load())]),
    ClassDef(
      name='QATableValidator_V546',
      body=[
        Expr(
          value=Constant(value='\n    v5.46: Comprehensive QA table validator with blocking logic.\n    \n    Validates all QA tables and blocks output delivery if critical\n    requirements are not met.\n    ')),
        FunctionDef(
          name='validate_word_count_table',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
              arg(arg='self'),
              arg(
                arg='table_text',
                annotation=Name(id='str', ctx=Load()))]),
          body=[
            Expr(
              value=Constant(value='\n        Validate QA Table 1 (Word Count Compliance).\n        \n        v5.46: Checks for:\n        - 7 required columns with correct names\n        - Tolerance in "+/- X%" format (not "Range" or absolute values)\n        - Total row as final row\n        - Variance calculations with signs\n        ')),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='blocking', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(ctx=Load())),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='warnings', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(ctx=Load())),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='required_cols', ctx=Store())],
              value=List(
                elts=[
                  Constant(value='Section'),
                  Constant(value='Expected (words)'),
                  Constant(value='Actual (words)'),
                  Constant(value='Variance (words)'),
                  Constant(value='Variance %'),
                  Constant(value='Tolerance'),
                  Constant(value='Pass/Fail')],
                ctx=Load())),
            For(
              target=Name(id='col', ctx=Store()),
              iter=Name(id='required_cols', ctx=Load()),
              body=[
                If(
                  test=BoolOp(
                    op=And(),
                    values=[
                      Compare(
                        left=JoinedStr(
                          values=[
                            Constant(value='| '),
                            FormattedValue(
                              value=Name(id='col', ctx=Load()),
                              conversion=-1)]),
                        ops=[
                          NotIn()],
                        comparators=[
                          Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())]),
                      Compare(
                        left=JoinedStr(
                          values=[
                            Constant(value='|'),
                            FormattedValue(
                              value=Name(id='col', ctx=Load()),
                              conversion=-1),
                            Constant(value='|')]),
                        ops=[
                          NotIn()],
                        comparators=[
                          Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())])]),
                  body=[
                    Expr(
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                          attr='append',
                          ctx=Load()),
                        args=[
                          JoinedStr(
                            values=[
                              Constant(value='Missing required column: '),
                              FormattedValue(
                                value=Name(id='col', ctx=Load()),
                                conversion=-1)])]))])]),
            If(
              test=BoolOp(
                op=Or(),
                values=[
                  Compare(
                    left=Constant(value='| Range |'),
                    ops=[
                      In()],
                    comparators=[
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())]),
                  Compare(
                    left=Constant(value='|Range|'),
                    ops=[
                      In()],
                    comparators=[
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())])]),
              body=[
                Expr(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='append',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Constant(value="Found 'Range' column - must be 'Tolerance'")]))]),
            If(
              test=BoolOp(
                op=And(),
                values=[
                  Compare(
                    left=Constant(value='Total'),
                    ops=[
                      NotIn()],
                    comparators=[
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())]),
                  Compare(
                    left=Constant(value='TOTAL'),
                    ops=[
                      NotIn()],
                    comparators=[
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())])]),
              body=[
                Expr(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='append',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Constant(value="Missing 'Total' row as final row (consolidates old QA Table 2)")]))]),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='lines', ctx=Store())],
              value=Call(
                func=Attribute(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='strip',
                      ctx=Load())),
                  attr='split',
                  ctx=Load()),
                args=[
                  Constant(value='\n')])),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='data_lines', ctx=Store())],
              value=ListComp(
                elt=Name(id='l', ctx=Load()),
                generators=[
                  comprehension(
                    target=Name(id='l', ctx=Store()),
                    iter=Name(id='lines', ctx=Load()),
                    ifs=[
                      BoolOp(
                        op=And(),
                        values=[
                          Call(
                            func=Attribute(
                              value=Call(
                                func=Attribute(
                                  value=Name(id='l', ctx=Load()),
                                  attr='strip',
                                  ctx=Load())),
                              attr='startswith',
                              ctx=Load()),
                            args=[
                              Constant(value='|')]),
                          Compare(
                            left=Constant(value='---'),
                            ops=[
                              NotIn()],
                            comparators=[
                              Name(id='l', ctx=Load())])])],
                    is_async=0)])),
            If(
              test=Compare(
                left=Call(
                  func=Name(id='len', ctx=Load()),
                  args=[
                    Name(id='data_lines', ctx=Load())]),
                ops=[
                  Gt()],
                comparators=[
                  Constant(value=1)]),
              body=[
                Assign(
                  targets=[
                    Name(id='last_row', ctx=Store())],
                  value=Subscript(
                    value=Name(id='data_lines', ctx=Load()),
                    slice=UnaryOp(
                      op=USub(),
                      operand=Constant(value=1)),
                    ctx=Load())),
                If(
                  test=BoolOp(
                    op=And(),
                    values=[
                      Compare(
                        left=Constant(value='Total'),
                        ops=[
                          NotIn()],
                        comparators=[
                          Name(id='last_row', ctx=Load())]),
                      Compare(
                        left=Constant(value='TOTAL'),
                        ops=[
                          NotIn()],
                        comparators=[
                          Name(id='last_row', ctx=Load())])]),
                  body=[
                    Expr(
                      value=Call(
                        func=Attribute(
                          value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                          attr='append',
                          ctx=Load()),
                        args=[
                          Constant(value="'Total' row must be the final row in table")]))])]),
            If(
              test=UnaryOp(
                op=Not(),
                operand=Call(
                  func=Attribute(
                    value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                    attr='search',
                    ctx=Load()),
                  args=[
                    Constant(value='\\+/-\\s*\\d+%'),
                    Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())])),
              body=[
                Expr(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='append',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Constant(value="Tolerance values must be in '+/- X%' format")]))]),
            If(
              test=BoolOp(
                op=And(),
                values=[
                  Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='re', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='search',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Constant(value='\\d+-\\d+'),
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())]),
                  Compare(
                    left=Constant(value='Tolerance'),
                    ops=[
                      In()],
                    comparators=[
                      Name(id='table_text', ctx=Load())])]),
              body=[
                Expr(
                  value=Call(
                    func=Attribute(
                      value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load()),
                      attr='append',
                      ctx=Load()),
                    args=[
                      Constant(value="Found absolute ranges (e.g., '450-550') - use percentage format")]))]),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='is_valid', ctx=Store())],
              value=Compare(
                left=Call(
                  func=Name(id='len', ctx=Load()),
                  args=[
                    Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load())]),
                ops=[
                  Eq()],
                comparators=[
                  Constant(value=0)])),
            Assign(
              targets=[
                Name(id='severity', ctx=Store())],
              value=IfExp(
                test=UnaryOp(
                  op=Not(),
                  operand=Name(id='is_valid', ctx=Load())),
                body=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='ValidationSeverity', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='BLOCKING',
                  ctx=Load()),
                orelse=Attribute(
                  value=Name(id='ValidationSeverity', ctx=Load()),
                  attr='INFO',
                  ctx=Load()))),
            Return(
              value=Call(
                func=Name(id='QAValidationResult', ctx=Load()),
                keywords=[
                  keyword(
                    arg='table_name',
                    value=Constant(value='QA Table 1 (Word Count Compliance)')),
                  keyword(
                    arg='is_valid',
                    value=Name(id='is_valid', ctx=Load())),
                  keyword(
                    arg='blocking_issues',
                    value=Name(id='blocking', ctx=Load())),
                  keyword(
                    arg='warning_issues',
                    value=Name(id='warnings', ctx=Load())),
                  keyword(
                    arg='severity',
                    value=Name(id='severity', ctx=Load()))]))],
          returns=Name(id='QAValidationResult', ctx=Load())),
        FunctionDef(
          name='validate_provenance_table',
          args=arguments(
            args=[
